use.\",\"1tuX3F\":\"What viewers get when the source is lost: first the backup stream, then the standby image.\",\"oP7Qo6\":\"When on, the player and HLS addresses without a code stop working, also a player embedded in a website and the player site. RTMP and SRT always need a code or the stream key. The preview in this panel keeps working.\",\"y88XJH\":\"When should it start?\",\"v1LoZm\":\"Where are the recordings and how long are they kept?\",\"5mb2Jo\":\"Where do I see the FFmpeg command and the log?\",\"iV4gX/\":\"Where should the backup stream come from?\",\"NGmcNp\":\"Where the picture and sound come from and how they are encoded.\",\"/QQonP\":\"Where the result is written.\",\"6Pz2IF\":\"Πού να αποθηκεύσετε τη λίστα αναπαραγωγής HLS και τα τμήματα. Συνιστάται η αποθήκευση στη μνήμη.\",\"UbFVPQ\":\"Which picture goes into the output.\",\"FT9rhf\":\"Which sound goes into the output.\",\"FFqHS7\":\"Which source should I use?\",\"KFzIbt\":\"While the source restarts, viewers see the backup for a few seconds.\",\"aWHAbR\":\"λευκό\",\"eYL7fx\":[\"Whole log (\",[\"0\"],\" lines)\"],\"c9e3oX\":\"Whom operators should call. Shown under Help > Support.\",\"SeQbZK\":\"Whom to call can be written here: System > General > Support text.\",\"aFWU1n\":\"Πλάτος\",\"9Efoaq\":\"With a key, only senders and players that carry it are accepted. Setting it restarts the server: every stream stops for a few seconds, and every device that sends to this server must get the new address before it can send again. Do this when nothing is on air.\",\"FFEjcY\":\"With a password the file is encrypted and useless without it; there is no way to recover a forgotten password. An encrypted file is imported with its password in the first field. Before an import, the current state is downloaded first, so you can go back.\",\"gmU+g8\":\"With a watch key the main key only sends from the internet; whoever watches from there uses the watch key, which cannot send. The server itself and the private network (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) keep using the main key, so the server's own processes and the local network are not affected.\",\"KLdPef\":\"Wizard\",\"e0wV2Y\":\"Προστασία εγγραφής\",\"+KXV8X\":\"Writes nothing: the process only measures.\",\"+F4wwU\":\"Writes the programme to files on this server.\",\"r5jQFV\":\"Writes what viewers get as HLS for the player.\",\"l75CjT\":\"Ναι\",\"WPUsOF\":\"Δεν μπορείτε να διακόψετε τον οδηγό, επειδή πρέπει να οριστεί τουλάχιστον μία είσοδος.\",\"uvHE7H\":\"You find the key under Status and tools → Keys.\",\"qwY9F9\":\"Έχετε αλλάξει τη διαμόρφωση. Για να τεθούν σε ισχύ οι αλλαγές, πρέπει να επανεκκινήσετε την εφαρμογή. Θέλετε να κάνετε επανεκκίνηση τώρα;\",\"nxq2ni\":\"Πρέπει να επανασυνδεθείτε χειροκίνητα\",\"RM3CEc\":\"Έχετε μη αποθηκευμένες αλλαγές. Παρακαλούμε αποθηκεύστε τις πριν μπορέσετε να ελέγξετε ξανά την υπηρεσία.\",\"/cg7qS\":\"Η ροή σας πρέπει να κωδικοποιηθεί, αλλά δεν υπάρχει διαθέσιμος κατάλληλος κωδικοποιητής.\",\"BwrOm6\":\"Η ροή σας πρέπει να κωδικοποιηθεί. Επιλέξτε τον επιθυμητό κωδικοποιητή:\",\"eqPmeO\":\"Μοτίβο δοκιμής YUV\"}")};
