mbre de usuario del dispositivo.\",\"Sxm8rQ\":\"Users\",\"zze3B5\":\"V4L2_M2M es experimental.\",\"0J2tLi\":\"Valid for\",\"lBntzH\":[\"valid until \",[\"0\"]],\"PvM7Yi\":\"Velocidad de fotogramas variable (VFR)\",\"hpBTpL\":\"terciopelo\",\"uIAsxu\":\"Volteo vertical\",\"vSJd18\":\"Vídeo\",\"auaWhL\":\"Dispositivo de vídeo\",\"/skRGV\":\"Ajustes de vídeo\",\"EzOjvB\":\"Configuración del vídeo\",\"QcQXbU\":\"Fuente de vídeo\",\"M/TIv1\":\"Visor\",\"v1Aj4N\":\"Viewer (optional)\",\"Nv/T6Y\":\"Viewer without a name\",\"zD+X6t\":\"Viewers and bandwidth\",\"L2hKw+\":\"violeta\",\"hA6FFn\":\"Fuente virtual\",\"/cF7Rs\":\"Volumen\",\"/gnt8J\":\"ID DE LA VPU\",\"a9q6hE\":\"waiting\",\"yXuZyz\":\"waiting / retrying\",\"Yn0d8K\":\"Waiting to retry\",\"jonrrx\":[\"waiting, next run in \",[\"0\"],\" s\"],\"staEyB\":\"Warning tone is off in this browser\",\"t2eO9t\":\"Warning tone is on\",\"XZnvO2\":\"Warns when what the viewers get has no sound, is black or does not move. It only warns: nothing is switched.\",\"itmxRJ\":\"was passed over: connected, but no data\",\"pBLCTN\":\"was restarted: no data for 30 s\",\"lIlOM/\":\"Watch a stream\",\"Yl68lB\":\"Watch key\",\"4X1UQP\":\"Watch settings\",\"9a4ij0\":\"Watch this channel\",\"wRy4hg\":\"Recomendamos OpenMAX IL para Raspberry PI (3/4) con un sistema operativo de 32 bits.\",\"6jfS51\":\"Welcome\",\"VmvVRS\":\"What do the sound meter and its warnings do?\",\"YblG5w\":\"What do viewers see when the source is lost?\",\"7azpIK\":\"What does \\\"Check before broadcast\\\" look at?\",\"lhlbNK\":\"What does Disconnect stop?\",\"VcjQtg\":\"What does the strip under the player show?\",\"LRnuU0\":\"What happens when I save?\",\"PXnlRt\":\"What is the process report for?\",\"A9QLUY\":\"What protects the panel?\",\"R08QdE\":\"What protects the streams?\",\"2cJahA\":\"What saving will do\",\"hJfWkA\":\"Qué preselección de velocidad utilizar.\",\"Gc+K5X\":\"What the player and the player page use.\",\"1tuX3F\":\"What viewers get when the source is lost: first the backup stream, then the standby image.\",\"oP7Qo6\":\"When on, the player and HLS addresses without a code stop working, also a player embedded in a website and the player site. RTMP and SRT always need a code or the stream key. The preview in this panel keeps working.\",\"y88XJH\":\"When should it start?\",\"v1LoZm\":\"Where are the recordings and how long are they kept?\",\"5mb2Jo\":\"Where do I see the FFmpeg command and the log?\",\"iV4gX/\":\"Where should the backup stream come from?\",\"NGmcNp\":\"Where the picture and sound come from and how they are encoded.\",\"/QQonP\":\"Where the result is written.\",\"6Pz2IF\":\"Dónde almacenar la lista de reproducción HLS y los segmentos. Se recomienda el almacenamiento en memoria.\",\"UbFVPQ\":\"Which picture goes into the output.\",\"FT9rhf\":\"Which sound goes into the output.\",\"FFqHS7\":\"Which source should I use?\",\"KFzIbt\":\"While the source restarts, viewers see the backup for a few seconds.\",\"aWHAbR\":\"blanco\",\"eYL7fx\":[\"Whole log (\",[\"0\"],\" lines)\"],\"c9e3oX\":\"Whom operators should call. Shown under Help > Support.\",\"SeQbZK\":\"Whom to call can be written here: System > General > Support text.\",\"aFWU1n\":\"Anchura\",\"9Efoaq\":\"With a key, only senders and players that carry it are accepted. Setting it restarts the server: every stream stops for a few seconds, and every device that sends to this server must get the new address before it can send again. Do this when nothing is on air.\",\"FFEjcY\":\"With a password the file is encrypted and useless without it; there is no way to recover a forgotten password. An encrypted file is imported with its password in the first field. Before an import, the current state is downloaded first, so you can go back.\",\"gmU+g8\":\"With a watch key the main key only sends from the internet; whoever watches from there uses the watch key, which cannot send. The server itself and the private network (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) keep using the main key, so the server's own processes and the local network are not affected.\",\"KLdPef\":\"Wizard\",\"e0wV2Y\":\"Protección de la escritura\",\"+KXV8X\":\"Writes nothing: the process only measures.\",\"+F4wwU\":\"Writes the programme to files on this server.\",\"r5jQFV\":\"Writes what viewers get as HLS for the player.\",\"l75CjT\":\"Sí\",\"WPUsOF\":\"No puede abortar el asistente porque al menos una entrada debe estar definida.\",\"uvHE7H\":\"You find the key under Status and tools → Keys.\",\"qwY9F9\":\"Ha cambiado la configuración. Para que los cambios surtan efecto, tiene que reiniciar la aplicación. ¿Quiere reiniciar ahora?\",\"nxq2ni\":\"Tiene que volver a conectarse manualmente\",\"RM3CEc\":\"Tiene cambios sin guardar. Por favor, guárdelos antes de poder controlar el servicio de nuevo.\",\"/cg7qS\":\"Su flujo necesita ser codificado, pero no hay un codificador adecuado disponible.\",\"BwrOm6\":\"Su flujo debe ser codificado. Elija el codificador deseado:\",\"eqPmeO\":\"Patrón de prueba YUV\"}")};
